      <pubDate>Fri, 29 Aug 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/project/derivative-matrix/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Built a sparse matrix-based derivative operator using Kronecker product formulation and incorporated
